n III, G. R., & Patterson, T. F. *Aspergillus species*. In Bennett, J. E., Dolin, R., Blaser, M. J., Eds. *Mandell, Douglas, & Bennett's Principles & Practice of Infectious Diseases*, (Elsevier, ed. 9, 2020), chap. 257.\n36. Hospenthal, D. R. Uncommon fungi and related species. In *Mandell, Douglas, & Bennett's Principles & Practice of Infectious Diseases*, Bennett, J. E., Dolin, R., Blaser, M. J., Eds. (Elsevier, ed. 9, 2020), chap. 268.\n37. Kidd, S., Halliday, C., Alexiou, H. & Ellis, D. *Descriptions of medical fungi*, 3rd edn. (published by the authors, 2016).\n\nDownload references\n\n## Acknowledgements\n\nWe are grateful to 2nd -year Medical Students of Kindai University Faculty of Medicine who served as volunteers for the mask experiments. We thank Ms. Namie Sakiyama for excellent technical assistance.\n\n## Funding\n\nThe Japan Society for the Promotion of Science Grants-in-Aid for Scientific Research-KAKENHI, 20K07455 (IT), 18K07379 (AMP), 21K07287 (AMP). All-Kindai University support project against COVID-19 (AMP, IT). Research Program on Emerging and Re-emerging Infectious Diseases from the Japan Agency for Medical Research and Development (AMED) under grant number 19fk0108168s0101 (IT).\n\n## Author information\n\n### Authors and Affiliations\n\n1. Department of Microbiology, Kindai University Faculty of Medicine, 377-2 Ohnohigashi, Osakasayama, Osaka, 589-8511, Japan\n\n   Ah-Mee Park, Sundar Khadka, Fumitaka Sato, Seiichi Omura, Mitsugu Fujita, Kazuki Hashiwaki & Ikuo Tsunoda\n\nAuthors\n\n1. Ah-Mee Park\n\n   View author publications\n\n   Search author on:PubMed Google Scholar\n2. Sundar Khadka\n\n   View author publications\n\n   Search author on:PubMed Google Scholar\n3. Fumitaka Sato\n\n   View author publications\n\n   Search author on:PubMed Google Scholar\n4. Seiichi Omura\n\n   View author publications\n\n   Search author on:PubMed Google Scholar\n5. Mitsugu Fujita\n\n   View author publications\n\n   Search author on:PubMed Google Scholar\n