 face masks under the COVID-19 pandemic.\n*Sci Rep* **12**, 11361 (2022). https://doi.org/10.1038/s41598-022-15409-x\n\nDownload citation\n\n* Received: 01 March 2022\n* Accepted: 23 June 2022\n* Published: 18 July 2022\n* Version of record: 18 July 2022\n* DOI: https://doi.org/10.1038/s41598-022-15409-x\n\n### Share this article\n\nAnyone you share the following link with will be able to read this content:\n\nSorry, a shareable link is not currently available for this article.\n\nProvided by the Springer Nature SharedIt content-sharing initiative","author":null,"published_date":"2022-07-18","latency_ms":2843.648017005762,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}